ite!", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"2\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Expressing Simple Requests</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Offering Help</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">Can you ... please?<br/>Could you ... ?\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"italic\\\">How can I help you?<br/>What can I get you?\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class = \"strong\">Helena</span>: Can you send that letter please?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Tim</span>: Uh-huh, sure.", "type": "example"}, {"content": "<span class = \"strong\">Clerk</span>: What can I get you?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Mike</span>: Could I have the tuna special, please?", "type": "example"}]}, {"type": "learning_points", "contents": [{"content": " Using Sounds and Expressions to Show You Are Listening", "type": "heading"}, {"content": "It is important to show that you understand when someone asks you a question.<br/>Use the following sounds and expressions to show you are listening.", "type": "describer"}, {"content": "{\"rows\":\"2\",\"columns\":\"2\",\"cells\":[\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Expressions</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"<span class = \\\"strong\\\">Sounds</span>\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"Alright<br/>Okay<br/>Sure\\\"}\",\"{\\\"type\\\": \\\"text\\\", \\\"content\\\": \\\"mmhmm<br/>uh-huh\\\"}\"],\"styles\":\" intro_table_border instruction_table_background\"}", "type": "table"}, {"content": "<span class = \"strong\">Helena</span>: Can you send that letter please?<br/><span class = \"strong\">Tim</span>: Uh-huh, sure.", "type": "example"}, 